sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant S as Shadow service
    alt Invalid token or connection identity
        C->>B: CONNECT
        B-->>C: Connection refused
    else Authenticated connection
        C->>B: SUBSCRIBE unauthorized reserved topic
        B-->>C: Denied subscription
        C->>B: PUBLISH unauthorized reserved topic
        Note over C,B: Broker rejects publication according to protocol policy<br/>No Shadow rejected response is guaranteed
        C->>B: PUBLISH authorized Shadow update with stale version
        B->>S: Forward request
        S-->>C: Via broker: update/rejected, code=409
    end
